<svg viewBox="0 0 680 270" width="100%" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<title>VI 攻击流程</title>
<desc>同一条连接内先加密已知明文再取flag密文，利用计数器错位异或还原flag</desc>
<defs>
<marker id="arr2" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse">
<path d="M2 1L8 5L2 9" fill="none" stroke="context-stroke" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</marker>
</defs>

<text x="40" y="44" font-size="12" fill="#5F5E5A">前提：四步必须在同一条连接内连续完成（key 和 iv0 每次连接都随机）</text>

<g>
<rect x="40" y="80" width="130" height="64" rx="10" fill="#E6F1FB" stroke="#185FA5" stroke-width="0.5"/>
<text x="105" y="104" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" font-size="13" font-weight="500" fill="#042C53">连接服务器</text>
<text x="105" y="126" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" font-size="11" fill="#0C447C">key、iv0 未知</text>
</g>
<line x1="172" y1="112" x2="192" y2="112" stroke="#185FA5" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arr2)"/>

<g>
<rect x="196" y="80" width="130" height="64" rx="10" fill="#E6F1FB" stroke="#185FA5" stroke-width="0.5"/>
<text x="261" y="104" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" font-size="13" font-weight="500" fill="#042C53">选 1：加密 A×64</text>
<text x="261" y="126" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" font-size="11" fill="#0C447C">计数器 iv0 → 得 C1</text>
</g>
<line x1="328" y1="112" x2="348" y2="112" stroke="#185FA5" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arr2)"/>

<g>
<rect x="352" y="80" width="130" height="64" rx="10" fill="#E6F1FB" stroke="#185FA5" stroke-width="0.5"/>
<text x="417" y="104" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" font-size="13" font-weight="500" fill="#042C53">选 3：取 flag 密文</text>
<text x="417" y="126" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" font-size="11" fill="#0C447C">计数器 iv0+1 → 得 C2</text>
</g>
<line x1="484" y1="112" x2="504" y2="112" stroke="#185FA5" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arr2)"/>

<g>
<rect x="508" y="80" width="132" height="64" rx="10" fill="#E1F5EE" stroke="#0F6E56" stroke-width="0.5"/>
<text x="574" y="104" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" font-size="13" font-weight="500" fill="#04342C">XOR 消掉密钥流</text>
<text x="574" y="126" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" font-size="11" fill="#0F6E56">得到明文 flag</text>
</g>

<rect x="40" y="176" width="600" height="44" rx="8" fill="#F1EFE8" stroke="#5F5E5A" stroke-width="0.5"/>
<text x="340" y="198" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" font-size="13" fill="#2C2C2A">flag[i] = C1[16+i] ^ C2[i] ^ 'A'　（i = 0 .. min(len(C1)-16, len(C2)) - 1）</text>

<text x="40" y="248" font-size="12" fill="#5F5E5A">已知明文 'A' 当垫脚石：KS[i] = C1[16+i] ^ 'A'，再 XOR 进 C2 把密钥流抵消。</text>
</svg>
